# Deliberately NO node_modules/ entry here: an unanchored `node_modules/` rule matches a
# directory with that name at ANY depth, which would silently drop
# node_modules/@red-cup-engineering/{feltos,qwzspace,arnold} — real, pinned dependencies this
# deploy needs shipped as-is via a plain `COPY . .` (see Dockerfile) — from the Cloud Run build
# context, exactly the failure aletheon's own Dockerfile records avoiding the same way.
.tmp/
*.log
